  "content": "<h3>因此，在 1.20 版本（23w14a）的新快照中，引入了新的全景图。</h3>\n<h2><strong>我制作了一个为这个新全景图添加光影的材质包！</strong></h2>\n<h2>同时也请查看我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-1-21-panorama-with-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21 带光影的全景图</a>！</h2>\n<p><img alt=\"\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshorturl.at%252f27Kvk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847523/description_8916b3b9-1d95-410f-8374-7e3cbe7d4df9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"168\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该种子由 <a style=\"font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MinecraftAtHome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft@Home</a> 团队发现。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull; 版本：Minecraft Java 快照 23w14a（1.19.4 同样适用）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull; 种子：8554477380691140270</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull; 坐标：X=1839.272 Y=128 Z=6312.295</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull; 游戏时间：23322 刻</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">光影：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.complementary.dev%252freimagined%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Reimagined</a>。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fswd-panorama\" rel=\"nofollow\">Panorama</a> 模组制作。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灵感来源于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itsmemed_552/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">@ItsMemed</a> 的 1.19 带光影全景图</span></p>",
